0..74 Comment "// What a recursion over decoded values refuses (#2862). A fixpoint stages"
75..147 Comment "// the code, so a tail call that keeps the code and descends only on the"
148..224 Comment "// value it decodes stands at the code\'s own stage; and a stage marks only a"
225..298 Comment "// data type, so the decoder\'s result, a function\'s, carries none. Agda\'s"
299..376 Comment "// sized types stop at the same place: a size sits on a constructor, never on"
377..448 Comment "// what a decoder returns. The model hands the value\'s own descent to a"
449..493 Comment "// function staged on the decoded family, in"
494..542 Comment "// `../../model/universe/decoded-descent.gandr`."
544..590 Comment "// The naturals, their addition and the lists."
591..597 Keyword "import"
