722..798 Comment "/// A list\'s entries and its tail summed at once: an entry\'s sum descends on"
799..877 Comment "/// the element code, the list code\'s field, but the tail\'s stands at the list"
878..954 Comment "/// code `ListL(a)` itself. The tail is below the value, and the value is no"
955..997 Comment "/// parameter the fixpoint stages (#2862)."
